Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.24,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,440)\an1\fs60\bord4\shad0\b1\3c&H8481B6&\blur9\an7\pos(90,200)}第四話{\fsp-5} {\fsp0}我討厭學習！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:40.01,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an5\pos(975,340)\fs70\bord5\shad0\blur8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H4042B4&\3a&44&}下一話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:40.01,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\an5\pos(960,630)\fs80\bord5\shad0\blur8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H4042B4&\3a&22&}森林的魔物令我驚艷！
